## Interface: 16001
## Title: Scrolling Loot Text
## Notes: Shows looted items, money, currency and honor as floating text that pops up mid-screen and drifts away, with item icon and rarity colour. (Patched for WoW Forever)
## Version: 1.1-forever
## X-Credits: Original Scrolling Loot Text by its CurseForge author. Forever port by good mens (Mephz on WoW Forever)
